{"id":"n41111-1-7","stage":5,"title":"내젓다 · 挥动","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41111-1-7-1","ko":"저기 맞은편에 지수 있다!","zh":"看，智秀在对面！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"맞은편에","meaning":"对面","explanation":"맞은편：对面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"맞은편","audio":"/audio/9af8d5855d31426b41d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57173","senseId":"1","lemma":"맞은편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞은편에","audio":"/audio/a25cc16a0e985a7f4442.mp3"}},{"text":"지수","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀","readings":[{"term":"지수","audio":"/audio/0d32317250d77806a4f2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수","audio":"/audio/0d32317250d77806a4f2.mp3"}},{"text":"있다!","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"9af8d5855d31426b","term":"맞은편","zh":"对面","audio":"/audio/9af8d5855d31426b41d8.mp3","entryId":"57173","definition":"相互可对视的正前方。","pronunciation":["마즌편"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/351be4de73229373cdd8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41111-1-7-2","ko":"우리를 알아볼 수 있게 팔을 크게 내저어 봐.","zh":"把手臂挥大一点，让她认出我们。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리를","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리를","audio":"/audio/2e24f478a23b082fd00d.mp3"}},{"text":"알아볼","meaning":"辨认，认出","explanation":"알아보다：辨认，认出；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"알아보다","audio":"/audio/1d2b64ddd329540a6838.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16080","senseId":"2","lemma":"알아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알아볼","audio":"/audio/3a2f16f617ebc3508c0d.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있게","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있게","audio":"/audio/d5f1c5fe3bed602d0c3e.mp3"}},{"text":"팔을","meaning":"臂，胳膊","explanation":"팔：臂，胳膊；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"팔","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32794","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팔을","audio":"/audio/ab326ac2eb36fe9a1cc5.mp3"}},{"text":"크게","meaning":"大，大大，大把地","explanation":"크다：大，大大，大把地；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"13","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"크게","audio":"/audio/39efead98c7d3ec847e